This file exists only as a fallback for older Cursor versions.

THE REAL RULES ARE IN `.cursor/rules/cruise-fm.mdc` — read that file now,
in full, before changing anything.

Then read `docs/CLAUDE_HANDOVER.md`, which is the project handover and points
at four further documents: PROJECT_ARCHITECTURE.md, CURRENT_STATE.md,
KNOWN_ISSUES.md and TODO.md.

Deliberately a pointer and not a copy: two files carrying the same rules drift
apart, and this project has been bitten by duplicated sources of truth more
than once (four copies of the mode scrim, eleven copies of the clock, two
copies of the shuffle state). One place to change, one place to read.
